# Run 417 evidence archive — foundational runtime-security reconciliation audit.
#
# Only publish-safe, transcribed text evidence is tracked in this directory:
#   README.md, summary.txt, source_trace.txt, findings_matrix.txt, commands.txt, SHA256SUMS.txt
#
# This is an audit archive. It contains NO keys, certificates, credentials, raw operator
# bundles, private endpoints, or private host identifiers. The patterns below are a backstop
# to ensure no raw capture / private material is ever committed into this directory.
bundles/
material/
node-data/
nodes/
logs/
data/
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.kem.sk.bin
*.cert.bin
*.root.bin
*.signing.key
*.sk.bin
*.hex
*.spec
*.err
*.log
